  itemDescription: "Nuclear Technologies Institute  This Institute leads R&D in nuclear
    science and technology. Its mission spans developing expertise in nuclear reactor
    technology, radiation safety, and nuclear fuel cycle processes. Key focus areas
    include supporting the operation and research use of Saudi Arabia\u2019s low-power
    research reactor (the Kingdom\u2019s first research reactor launched in 2018),
    designing small modular reactor (SMR) concepts for potential energy use, and
    nuclear medicine applications (like radioisotopes for cancer treatment). The
    institute also emphasizes training and qualification of nuclear engineers, as
    well as ensuring nuclear safety and security measures in line with international
    standards. Ultimately, it provides the technical backbone for any future peaceful
    nuclear energy initiatives in the Kingdom"
